# 6 Plotting Coffechain Sales report

## 6.1 Plotting Sparklines



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
report %>%
  group_by(Product) %>%
  summarize('Monthly Sales' = list(Sales), 
            .groups = "drop") %>%
   gt() %>%
   gt_plt_sparkline('Monthly Sales',
                    same_limit = FALSE) %>%
  tab_style(
    style = cell_fill(color = "#f3f1e9"), 
    locations = cells_body()
  ) %>%
  tab_style(
    style = list(cell_fill(color = "#f3f1e9"),
                 cell_text(weight = "bold")),
    locations = cells_column_labels())
```

