## 7.4 Adding bandline

Instead adding reference line, bandline can be added by using the `bandline` argument.



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
reactable(
  report,
  defaultPageSize = 13,
  columns = list(
    Product = colDef(
      maxWidth = 200,
      style = list(backgroundColor = "#f3f1e9"),
      headerStyle = list(backgroundColor = "#f3f1e9")
      ),
    `Monthly Sales` = colDef(
      cell = react_sparkline(
        report,
        highlight_points = highlight_points(
          min = "red", max = "blue"),
        line_width = 1,
        bandline = "innerquartiles",
        bandline_color = "green"
        ),
      style = list(backgroundColor = "#f3f1e9"),
      headerStyle = list(backgroundColor = "#f3f1e9"),
    )
  )
)
```

